# Temporary and backup files.
#
# CAVEAT, measured 2026-09-05: `*.tmp` below CANNOT exclude a ROOT file whose
# name stem is `readme`, `license`, `licence` or `copying` (case-insensitive,
# any extension). npm's packlist force-includes those, overriding both this
# file and the `files` allowlist in package.json, so a scratch `README.md.tmp`
# — or, since this package ships `LICENSE`, a `LICENSE.tmp` — WOULD be
# published. Probes: `README.junk` was included, `READMEXYZ.junk` was not, and
# `CHANGELOG.md.tmp` / `SECURITY.md.tmp` were correctly excluded. The globs are
# root-anchored, so a backup under a subdirectory is unaffected. No
# configuration suppresses the rule — delete any such file before packing, and
# treat an `npm pack --dry-run` count other than 31 files as a failure.
*.tmp
*.bak
*.backup
*~

# Security and sensitive files
.npmrc
.yarnrc
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx

